<title>USA: Axsys gets 72 pct of preferred in offer.</title>
<headline>Axsys gets 72 pct of preferred in offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Axsys Technologies Inc said on Tuesday it received and accepted 530,000 of its preferred shares, or 72 percent of those outstanding, in response to an exchange offer it began on February 14.</p>
<p>The exchange offer expired Monday.</p>
<p>Axsys supplies precision optical components and other precision components.</p>
